<b>with each other.</b>

00:36:20.941 --> 00:36:25.154
<b>To me, being together means that you try</b>

00:36:25.154 --> 00:36:28.282
<b>to listen more to the other person,</b
<b>because that's where it starts, because we can...</b></b>

00:36:28.282 --> 00:36:31.911
<b>We all live in an incredibly</b>
<b>complex, modern world.</b>

00:36:31.911 --> 00:36:34.580
<b>Everyone has different life plans</b>
<b>and prerequisites.</b>

00:36:34.580 --> 00:36:39.043
<b>And the encounter itself</b>
<b>is influenced by so many other factors</b>

00:36:39.043 --> 00:36:42.338
<b>in advance that</b>
<b>you simply have to re-learn,</b>

00:36:42.338 --> 00:36:46.467
<b>to listen to people and</b>
<b>engage with your counterpart.</b>

00:36:46.717 --> 00:36:47.885
<b>‘Being together’ means</b>

00:36:47.885 --> 00:36:52.640
<b>not just sitting together, it means that</b>

00:36:52.640 --> 00:36:54.808
<b>you understand the person correctly,</b>

00:36:55.100 --> 00:36:57.102
<b>you feel the emotions,</b>

00:36:58.604 --> 00:37:00.105
<b>what are they thinking about</b>

00:37:00.105 --> 00:37:02.274
<b>and what will they do next</b>

00:37:02.525 --> 00:37:06.862
<b>It's something that comes from</b>
<b>the inside and not from the outside.</b>

00:37:07.112 --> 00:37:08.656
<b>‘Being together’</b>

00:37:08.656 --> 00:37:11.408
<b>I always remember, it was 2019,</b>

00:37:11.700 --> 00:37:13.744
<b>Mrs Holze.</b>

00:37:13.744 --> 00:37:17.248
<b>We asked what ‘being together’ means to her.</b>

00:37:17.248 --> 00:37:18.874
<b>And she always said:</b>

00:37:18.874 --> 00:37:22.545
<b>‘Singing, dancing and just being together'.</b>

00:37:22.545 --> 00:37:25.923
<b>And I always have that in my head.</b>

00:37:25.923 --> 00:37:28.384
<b>'Being together' is a beautiful thing,</b>

00:37:28.384 --> 00:37:32.513
<b>because you can simply rely on each other</b>
<b>when you have a good time together.</b>

00:37:33.430 --> 00:37:34.890
<b>‘Being together’</b>

00:37:35.724 --> 00:37:39.645
<b>Spending time together</b>
<b>and being there for each other,</b>

00:37:39.645 --> 00:37:41.939
<b>to be able to rely on each other.</b>

00:37:42.856 --> 00:37:45.192
<b>‘Being together’ means a lot to me.</b>

00:37:45.568 --> 00:37:48.737
<b>I have no friends here, we are alone,</b>

00:37:48.737 --> 00:37:50.197
<b>and I only have my family</b>

00:37:50.197 --> 00:37:52.533
<b>So, I think being together</b>

00:37:52.533 --> 00:37:55.995
<b>and having contact with people</b>

00:37:55.995 --> 00:37:58.831
<b>just makes me happy.</b>

00:37:58.831 --> 00:38:00.916
<b>It gives me a feeling of ‘home’.</b>

00:38:00.916 --> 00:38:02.710
<b>This can also be my home.</b>

00:38:03.085 --> 00:38:07.464
<b>Being together is something</b>

00:38:07.464 --> 00:38:09.800
<b>very important for me.</b>

00:38:09.842 --> 00:38:11.885
<b>I would like to say,</b>

00:38:11.885 --> 00:38:14.346
<b>especially being together</b>

00:38:14.346 --> 00:38:16.849
<b>with the person you love.</b>

00:38:16.849 --> 00:38:19.727
<b>This being together</b>

00:38:19.727 --> 00:38:23.230
<b>is for me in my life</b>

00:38:23.272 --> 00:38:27.568
<b>the greatest thing there can be.</b>

00:38:27.568 --> 00:38:29.778
<b>Life is beautiful</b>

00:38:30.529 --> 00:38:33.073
<b>and in a community with others</b>

00:38:33.574 --> 00:38:36.410
<b>it's especially worth living.</b>

00:40:19.054 --> 00:40:22.725
<b>So I thought this gala was really great.</b>

00:40:22.975 --> 00:40:25.728
<b>What was on offer</b>

00:40:25.728 --> 00:40:30.649
<b>for us as old people.</b>

00:40:30.649 --> 00:40:32.568
<b>That was very good.</b>

00:40:33.068 --> 00:40:35.988
<b>You can take a lot from that,</b>

00:40:35.988 --> 00:40:39.908
<b>when you see other people</b>
<b>how they move or</b>

00:40:39.908 --> 00:40:44.413
<b>how they take it in.</b>

00:40:44.413 --> 00:40:46.999
<b>It's not everyone...</b>

00:40:46.999 --> 00:40:48.208
<b>No</b>

00:40:48.876 --> 00:40:51.086
<b>I enjoy that</b>

00:40:51.086 --> 00:40:55.299
<b>and am happy when others,</b>
<b>like last time,</b>

00:40:55.299 --> 00:40:58.302
<b>can move so beautifully and all that.</b>

00:40:59.386 --> 00:41:01.805
<b>Sometimes that makes me envious.</b>

00:41:02.639 --> 00:41:04.475
<b>Yes, so I've learnt from that,</b>

00:41:04.475 --> 00:41:07.519
<b>as I've always known,</b>
<b>that we can achieve things together.</b>

00:41:07.519 --> 00:41:08.896
<b>But we can only do it together.</b>

00:41:08.896 --> 00:41:11.440
<b>It was very funny</b>

00:41:11.440 --> 00:41:15.027
<b>and together all of us</b>

00:41:15.027 --> 00:41:18.947
<b>made some really nice progress, I think.</b>

00:41:19.615 --> 00:41:24.495
<b>And since then I can't get</b>
<b>the 'Tulpen aus Amsterdam' out of my head.</b>

00:41:24.745 --> 00:41:27.790
<b>I would never have expected</b>
<b>that this would give me here</b>

00:41:31.752 --> 00:41:34.671
<b>in the home for elderly</b>

00:41:34.671 --> 00:41:36.965
<b>such strange feelings again.</b>

00:41:38.050 --> 00:41:40.093
<b>Thank you.</b>

00:41:43.847 --> 00:41:47.059
<b>Well, when Tutipsy told me about the project,</b>

00:41:47.059 --> 00:41:50.103
<b>I was almost knocked off my feet.</b>

00:41:50.103 --> 00:41:53.065
<b>At first I only saw the</b>
<b>organisational effort and thought</b>

00:41:53.065 --> 00:41:54.900
<b>'Oh, is that - is that feasible?'</b>

00:41:54.900 --> 00:41:56.777
<b>But then I thought yes, okay, why not?</b>

00:41:56.777 --> 00:41:59.530
<b>We can reach for the stars</b>
<b>and maybe we'll end up somewhere else.</b>

00:41:59.530 --> 00:42:01.657
<b>But we, we'll achieve something with it.</b>

00:42:01.657 --> 00:42:03.158
<b>I was actually worried,</b>

00:42:03.158 --> 00:42:06.954
<b>that it would be too much work,</b>
<b>but in the end,</b>

00:42:06.954 --> 00:42:11.625
<b>what it has become and what we've</b>
<b>heard from the various people,</b>

00:42:11.625 --> 00:42:15.254
<b>the feedback and the gratitude,</b
<b>it was all worth</b></b>

00:42:15.254 --> 00:42:17.589
<b>what we did.</b>

00:42:18.799 --> 00:42:20.384
<b>When I look back,</b>

00:42:20.384 --> 00:42:22.928
<b>we had very, very limited resources.</b>

00:42:22.928 --> 00:42:27.683
<b>But everyone came together,</b>

00:42:27.683 --> 00:42:30.352
<b>to put together this beautiful puzzle.</b>

00:42:30.686 --> 00:42:33.772
<b>And that's the good thing about</b>
<b>working with experts,</b>

00:42:33.772 --> 00:42:38.694
<b>who have experience and with people</b>
<b>who have a passion,</b>

00:42:38.694 --> 00:42:41.071
<b>to make a project like this possible.</b>

00:42:41.071 --> 00:42:45.200
<b>We had people,</b>

00:42:45.200 --> 00:42:47.411
<b>with a common goal.</b>

00:42:47.411 --> 00:42:49.121
<b>We had different generations.</b>

00:42:49.121 --> 00:42:54.042
<b>The youngest person in our project</b>
<b>was 9 years old and the oldest person was 96.</b>

00:42:54.042 --> 00:42:59.882
<b>And for me that is,</b>
<b>looking back,</b>

00:42:59.882 --> 00:43:01.174
<b>that's something special.</b>

00:43:01.174 --> 00:43:04.887
<b>Many of the participants</b>
<b>couldn't remember their last dance.</b>

00:43:04.887 --> 00:43:07.598
<b>But through the project...</b>

00:43:07.598 --> 00:43:09.057
<b>Through all of us</b>

00:43:09.057 --> 00:43:12.227
<b>we were able to bring</b>
<b>their memories back to life.</b>

